    "body": "`README.md` tells you to add `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` to `.env`, but `.env.example` doesn't list that variable, and its comment offers only `mock` and `openai` for `LLM_PROVIDER`. `core/config.py` defines both keys. Make the two files agree.\n\n**Relevant files:**\n- `README.md`\n- `.env.example`\n\n**Estimated effort:** 1–2 hours\n",
