    "body": "`core/security.py` lets passlib's `UnknownHashError` escape when the stored hash is not a recognizable format. Verification against a malformed hash should fail closed (return `False`), not raise.\n\nThe covering test is marked `@pytest.mark.xfail` referencing manifest id H-05 — remove the marker as part of the fix.\n\n**Relevant files:**\n- `core/security.py`\n- `tests/unit/test_security.py`\n\n**Estimated effort:** 1–2 hours\n",
